The registry-first sample tests/registry/no.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from
Kartverket's Matrikkelen - Adresse national CSV export of 2026-10-10. © Kartverket,
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Dataset: https://kartkatalog.geonorge.no/metadata/uuid/f7df7a18-b30f-4745-bd64-d0863812350c.
Queries include constructed variants; per-case export checksums and retrieval dates are recorded
in the corpus. The data is provided as is, without a guarantee of accuracy.
